SUMMARY:Pitch It Good – Live
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:What happens when comedians are handed a secret genre and told 
 to pitch a movie... live\, unscripted\, on the spot? Chaos. Beautiful\, stu
 pid chaos. The Golden Lobes Best Live Show-nominated podcast brings its six
 th live outing to Edinburgh\, with a growing roster of guest comedians who 
 keep coming back for more. Past pitchers include Sikisa\, Josh James\, Made
 line Brettingham and Chantal Nash. Hosted by lifelong friends Jim Hooker (S
 o You Think You're Funny\, West End New Act Runner Up) and Paul Ormerod (si
 lly billy). Great fun guaranteed.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comed
 y-atlas/event/pitch-it-good-live/
